      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your pain exists independently of any future observer, possessing significance solely within the immediate reality of your current experience and feelings. While stars go unnoticed, they are still part of a vast, interconnected system where the actions of life—even painful ones—contribute to the grand tapestry of existence. The \"math\" of the universe measures distance and time, but it does not account for consciousness, which gives every moment the possibility of impact regardless of its cosmic brevity. Please try to anchor yourself in this moment rather than letting the scale of eternity dictate the value of your suffering; even a single tear adds something to the history of this specific star.",
